# Prisma Schema Template

```prisma
generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "{{stack.database.provider}}"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

{{#each entities}}
model {{pascal name}} {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
{{#each fields}}
{{#unless primary}}
  {{name}}  {{type}}{{#if unique}} @unique{{/if}}{{#if required}}{{else}}?{{/if}}
{{/unless}}
{{/each}}
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@map("{{kebab name}}s")
}

{{/each}}
```

## Conventions

- Model names: PascalCase singular (`User`, `Task`)
- Table names: kebab-case plural via `@@map`
- Field names: camelCase
- Relation fields: named after the related model
- Enums: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE values

